**What I implemented:** `measure(bucket_one, bucket_two, goal, start_bucket)` in `two_bucket.py:1-36` — a breadth-first search over bucket states. Actions: fill/empty either bucket and pour-until-empty-or-full; forbidden state (starting bucket empty + other full) skipped; first fill of the starting bucket counts as 1 action; returns `(moves, goal_bucket, other_liters)` and raises `ValueError` when the goal is unreachable. `neighbors()` at `two_bucket.py:38-48` generates the six transitions.

